          "text": "The semantic-direction edits also failed, so I won\u2019t retain them. I\u2019ll next test the linear-attention memory dynamics. Several late-layer heads have baseline decay half-lives of only a few hundred tokens; extending those heads\u2019 retention may help preserve completed reasoning without directly biasing answer tokens.",
